ready: 1
kind: quality
id: identity.quality.deliberate-changes
display_id: QC-IDENTITY-DELIBERATE
module: identity
title: Identity layers change only deliberately
applies_to:
  - identity.seq.narrative
  - consolidation.rule.promotion-gates
  - consolidation.seq.sleep
measure: >-
  Changes to values, foundational beliefs, and self-narratives, classified by what caused them,
  over a run of sleep, processing, exhaust, and imports.
target: >-
  Every change comes from the agent's deliberate call or an accepted suggestion; none comes from
  sleep, processing, or exhaust directly.
